.TH MC1-CVMFS-FETCH-RPMS 1 "2026-10-08" "mu2edaq-batch-queues" "Mu2e DAQ Tools"
.SH NAME
mc1-cvmfs-fetch-rpms \- download and verify the CernVM-FS client RPMs for the MC1 deployer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mc1-cvmfs-fetch-rpms
.RB [ \-V
.IR version ]
.RB [ \-\-el
.IR list ]
.RB [ \-\-url
.IR base ]
.RB [ \-o
.IR dir ]
.RB [ \-n ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs on the operator machine. For each EL major release it reads the
repository metadata of the CERN CVMFS yum repository, selects
.BR cvmfs ,
.B cvmfs-libs
and
.B cvmfs-fuse3
at
.I version
and the newest
.BR cvmfs-config-default ,
downloads them, and checks each file's SHA-256 against the metadata. Files
land in
.IR artifacts/rpms/cvmfs/<version>/el<N>/ ,
which the
.B cvmfs
role copies to the nodes. A file that is already present with the right
checksum is not downloaded again; older builds of the same package are
removed so the role finds exactly one.
.PP
The MC1 nodes therefore never contact cvmrepo themselves. Package
dependencies (fuse3, autofs, gdb, ...) still come from the nodes' OS
repositories.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-V ", " \-\-version " version"
cvmfs release (env
.BR MC1_CVMFS_VERSION ,
default 2.14.1). Must match
.B mc1_cvmfs_version
in
.IR config/group_vars/all.yml .
.TP
.BI \-\-el " list"
Comma-separated EL majors (env
.BR MC1_CVMFS_EL ,
default 9,10).
.TP
.BI \-\-url " base"
Repository base above
.I <el>/x86_64
(env
.BR MC1_CVMFS_REPO_URL ,
default https://cvmrepo.s3.cern.ch/cvmrepo/yum/cvmfs/EL).
.TP
.BI \-o ", " \-\-out " dir"
Output root (default
.IR artifacts/rpms/cvmfs/<version> ).
.TP
.BR \-n ", " \-\-dry\-run
List what would be fetched.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
Command-line options override the environment, which overrides the defaults.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success; non-zero if a package is missing from the repository or a
checksum does not match (the bad file is not written).
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
scripts/mc1-cvmfs-fetch-rpms
scripts/mc1-cvmfs-fetch-rpms \-n \-V 2.14.1 \-\-el 9
scripts/mc1-slurm-deploy cvmfs            # dry run with the bundle
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mc1-slurm-deploy (1),
.BR mc1-slurm-build-rpms (1)
